## ----- jm_at.claims.* -----
## [tx] Land-claim (grief-protection) engine: chat/action-bar messages for the Claim Tool two-corner
## [tx] selection flow, the claim viewer overlay shown when inspecting claimed land, live verdict
## [tx] hints while selecting, and rejection reasons/warnings when creating, expanding, extending or
## [tx] overwriting claims and sub-claims. Land is measured in Minecraft chunks against a
## [tx] playtime-earned area budget.

jm_at.claims.viewer_admin=§c§l管理員領地
## [tx] %1$s = the admin claim's custom name, shown after the fixed "Admin Claim" type label.
jm_at.claims.viewer_admin_named=§c§l管理員領地§r §l§7%1$s
## [tx] Action-bar overlay while looking at claimed land. %1$s = the claim's corner coordinates
## [tx] (e.g. "12,60,3 → 44,80,19"), %2$s = an owner/admin label (viewer_admin, viewer_admin_named
## [tx] or viewer_owner_named).
jm_at.claims.viewer_bar=§c§l[領地]§r（%1$s）%2$s
jm_at.claims.viewer_none=§2此處沒有領地。
## [tx] Two field labels shown side by side in the action bar. %1$s = name of the player who owns
## [tx] the claim, %2$s = the claim's custom name.
jm_at.claims.viewer_owner_named=§q§l擁有者：%1$s§r §l§7領地名稱：%2$s
jm_at.claims.wand_admin_only=§c[領地] 領地僅限於該伺服器上的管理員。
