## [tx] Chat line while marking land with the Claim Tool. %1$s = number of chunks in the selection
## [tx] (can be 1), %2$s = a complete hint sentence (one of the jm_at.claims.hint_* strings).
jm_at.claims.wand_selection=§9[領地] 選擇：§r%1$s 塊 · %2$s
## [tx] Playtime reward notice. %1$s = number of chunks just added to the player's claimable-area
