jm_at.deathback.btn_tp_anyway=§l§c無論如何傳送
## [tx] Fragment inserted as %1$s into "Teleporting to %1$s...", "Teleported to %1$s." and "Arrived
## [tx] at %1$s" (jm_at.tp.* keys); keep it a short lowercase noun phrase that reads naturally in
## [tx] those frames.
